.git
.gitignore
data/sessions/*
!data/sessions/.gitkeep
# Runtime-written, like data/sessions above: recordings accumulate here and are
# gitignored, so they must not ride into the image. They would also survive
# `down -v`, since an empty named volume initializes from the image's contents.
# The seed repopulates both dirs from samples/ at container start.
static/screenshots/*
# README illustrations only — no reason to ship them in the image.
screenshots/
pnpm-lock.yaml
